{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>NoteBoard 是為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的寧靜工作區，把任務、項目與 Markdown 筆記集中一處。它適合需要捕捉靈感、安排今日工作及整理項目資料的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-256.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>集中任務與筆記工作區</h2>\n<p>可把想法捕捉到收件匣，逐項整理；今日清單協助聚焦，未處理工作可移至稍後。項目支援列表、看板、日曆、心智圖與空間化 Corral，Markdown 筆記可加入連結與表格，並把筆記和任務放到畫布。內建搜尋顯示筆記與任務的相符摘要，亦可備份工作區、還原至新資料夾及預覽舊版本。捷徑可傳送文字與連結。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-259-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-260-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-261-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-262-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-263-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：NoteBoard: markdown and kanban</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/noteboard-markdown-and-kanban/id6758316122?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:24:16.670987+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T19:56:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:43.388270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:46.968661+00:00","content_hash":"98612f4f87a9cdd040025d5ff5d75602eef98e98ebb2be319eb92041c827eede","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}